1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,360
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,720
=The One=

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,280
=Episode 22=

17
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,230
Mr. Cheng.

18
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,230
Here's your schedule for tomorrow.

19
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,550
At 2 p.m., a video call
with the overseas foundation.

20
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,710
Mom, we've been waiting forever!

21
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,590
Sorry to keep you waiting.

22
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:43,270
Mr. Cheng.

23
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,990
Mr. Ji will be at headquarters

24
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,710
for project updates from you
and the branch managers.

25
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,350
Is our signing with Xincheng Law Firm

26
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,670
confirmed?

27
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,310
Yes.

28
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,670
Ms. Su will be here tomorrow.

29
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,030
Also, we found that Ms. Su...

30
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,710
Mr. Cheng, these documents
need your signature.

31
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:14,910
Sign here, Mr. Cheng.

32
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:20,550
Mr. Cheng, this is the quarterly report.

33
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,590
This quarter's numbers look good.

34
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,270
Does this section need revising?

35
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,350
Mr. Cheng? Mr. Cheng?

36
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,670
Could you sign this?

37
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,470
(He really has grown up.)

38
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,270
Here's the renewal contract.

39
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,990
Please review it, Mr. Cheng.

40
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,710
The supplemental terms

41
00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:05,030
are here.

42
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,990
It's been a few years.

43
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:21,390
Why so formal with me, Ms. Su?

44
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,230
Mr. Cheng.

45
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,150
Here's the renewal contract.

46
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,310
Please review it when you have time.

47
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,990
I have something else to take care of.

48
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,670
Mr. Zhou will personally handle

49
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,190
the renewal signing.

50
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,190
Your hands are still so cold.

51
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:57,990
Mr. Cheng.

52
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,630
Please mind where we are.

53
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,910
You're avoiding me.

54
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,550
Why would I avoid you?

55
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:07,190
Then look me in the eye

56
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,710
and answer me.

57
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,630
In the past five years,

58
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,750
did you ever think about me?

59
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,510
For five years,

60
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,750
I've been busy running the firm,

61
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,110
and raising a child.

62
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,270
Every day's been a battle.

63
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,510
Why would I dwell on

64
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,830
a story that's already over?

65
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,430
Now,

66
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:44,070
you're finally where you wanted to be.

67
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,430
Things turned out

68
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,390
just fine.

69
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,110
Okay.

70
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:57,590
I'll be right there.

71
00:03:59,120 --> 00:03:59,710
Give me your phone.

72
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:00,470
Give me.

73
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,430
Su Yan.

74
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,150
It's Cheng Lin.

75
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:07,100
♪Not every memory that stays♪

76
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:09,150
♪Deserves to be etched in your heart♪

77
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:11,220
♪Not every love♪

78
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:13,020
♪Can give you a place to belong♪

79
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:15,000
♪You don't have to make this hard♪

80
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,750
Cheng Lin.

81
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:17,390
It's over between us.

82
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:18,630
I'm married.

83
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,950
And I have a child.

84
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:20,750
We...

85
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,590
You're lying.

86
00:04:21,590 --> 00:04:22,600
♪Not every goodbye♪

87
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,880
♪Means betraying what was real♪

88
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:24,870
I know the truth.

89
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:26,810
♪I got too caught up♪

90
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,350
(We also found that Ms. Su is single.)

91
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,820
(She never married Duan Cizhou.)

92
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:38,210
♪Some love is still there♪

93
00:04:38,210 --> 00:04:39,880
♪But I can't put it into words♪

94
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:43,320
♪Those who love deeply never change♪

95
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:43,790
Cheng Lin.

96
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:45,910
From the very beginning,

97
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,670
what we had was a mistake.

98
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,110
Over the past five years,
we've each had our own lives.

99
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,150
I'm happy with mine.

100
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:54,390
I don't want to waste any more time
on another relationship.

101
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,270
And I don't want to waste more time

102
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,710
getting hurt again.

103
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,950
I'm done playing games with love.

104
00:04:59,950 --> 00:05:00,800
♪Our story♪

105
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,780
♪Changed♪

106
00:05:01,780 --> 00:05:02,200
♪With memories overflowing♪

107
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,150
Games?

108
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,870
Is that really how you see what we had?

109
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:08,950
(Tell me.)

110
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:11,150
(What does Cheng Lin mean to you?)

111
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,150
(From now on,)

112
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,790
(I'll work to be good enough for you.)

113
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:17,400
(I don't know why I acted like that
tonight.)

114
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,910
(Maybe I just like you too much.)

115
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,230
(Isn't it better)

116
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:21,830
(to face it together?)

117
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,390
(Please let me)

118
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,550
(into your life.)

119
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,110
(Will you?)

120
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:32,390
Su Yan.

121
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,990
Give me another chance.

122
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:38,870
Cheng Lin.

123
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,710
I don't want to keep saying this.

124
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,870
Stop wasting your time on me.

125
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,470
All I want now is to love Tangtang

126
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,390
and myself.

127
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,630
You won't even

128
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,830
give me 20%?

129
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,150
(I used to give others 80% of my love)

130
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,550
(and keep only 20% for myself.)

131
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,710
(But now,)

132
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,190
(I want to keep 80% for myself.)

133
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,670
I'm saying this one last time.

134
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,270
Stop wasting your time on me.

135
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,360
♪With memories overflowing♪

136
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,150
Su Yan.

137
00:06:14,540 --> 00:06:16,510
♪I'm still the one left behind♪

138
00:06:16,510 --> 00:06:17,480
♪Never once did I♪

139
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,160
♪Run straight into love♪

140
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:22,600
♪I still wasn't the one you chose♪

141
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:26,470
(Su Yan.)

142
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,790
(I'll prove I'm the one for you.)

143
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:31,300
(Su Yan.)

144
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:33,500
(Tell me.)

145
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:35,920
(What would make you feel better?)

146
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:39,380
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

147
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:42,900
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

148
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:46,420
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

149
00:06:46,420 --> 00:06:50,180
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

150
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:08,660
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

151
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:12,300
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

152
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:15,500
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

153
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:19,180
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

154
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:22,580
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

155
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:26,260
♪I hum this song alone♪

156
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:30,100
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

157
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:34,180
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

158
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:37,460
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

159
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:41,060
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

160
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:44,540
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

161
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:49,420
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
